From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:32:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] A live VR quality step: rtxvr_SetQuality (API 4)

The session layer outranks every route Lua has, and the render scale was latched at Start.
SetQuality records a step; the render thread writes the five ladder values into the session
layer and reallocates the eye images when the scale changes. The centre projection follows at
once, as it does for an IPD change. The status carries the step in use. The top step is V1s
fixed preset, so an untouched session renders as before.
